# S012499 candidate summary

Added `src/include/asm-generic/audit_change_attr.rs` with immutable provenance
for `include/asm-generic/audit_change_attr.h` at Linux revision
`425f94c2954b1fe80ebdbf9b29854e89750355df`.

The source is a conditional preprocessor initializer fragment rather than a
declaration. Its four selected concrete expansions are represented by exported
caller-supplied macros:

- `audit_change_attr_x86_64_native!` — 18 entries;
- `audit_change_attr_x86_64_ia32!` — 21 entries;
- `audit_change_attr_aarch64_native!` — 14 entries;
- `audit_change_attr_aarch64_compat!` — 21 entries.

Every expansion retains upstream order and conditional membership. Values are
explicit `u32`, preserving the consumers' `unsigned int` element width; the
consumers retain ownership of their static array and terminal `~0U` value.
